<title>USA: Imation completes Cemax-Icon acquisition.</title>
<headline>Imation completes Cemax-Icon acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imation Corp said Monday it completed its acquisition of Cemax-Icon Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Cemax-Icon is a software developer and network systems integrator of medical imaging and information management systems based in Fremont, Calif.</p>
<p>&quot;With the completion of this acquisition, we are now well-poised to focus on helping our customers make the transition from conventional to digital radiology workflow solutions,&quot; said Bill Monahan, chairman and chief executive of Imation.</p>
<p>	 -- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
